统，微服务系统包含了8个基础服务，提供了一整套微服务治理功能，他们分别是配置中心module_config、注册中心module_eureka、认证授权中心module_uaa、Turbine聚合监控服务module_monitor、链路追踪服务module_zipken、聚合监控服务module_admin、路由网关服务module_gateway、日志服务module_log。另外还包含了两个资源服务：用户服务module_user和blog服务module_blog，另外还有一个common的Module,为资源服务提供一些一本的工具类","full_name":"mxdldev/spring-cloud-flycloud","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":null,"90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":0,"180d":2,"1d":0,"30d":0,"365d":7,"7d":null,"90d":1},"github_url":"https://github.com/mxdldev/spring-cloud-flycloud","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNzA2MDMzODU=","stars":1579},{"description":"Chinese translation of the Spring Framework 4.x Reference Documentation (https://docs.spring.io/spring/docs/4.3.13.RELEASE/spring-framework-reference/html/) .中文翻译《Spring Framework 4.x参考文档》 ","full_name":"waylau/spring-framework-4-reference","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":null,"90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":0,"180d":0,"1d":0,"30d":0,"365d":0,"7d":null,"90d":0},"github_url":"https://github.com/waylau/spring-framework-4-reference","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyODU1MTY1NA==","stars":1442},{"description":"An open source, free, high performance, stable and secure Java Application Business Platform of Project Management and Document","full_name":"MyCollab/mycollab","gain_source":{"15d":"history","180d":"history","1d":"snapshot","30d":"history","365d":"history","7d":null,"90d":"history"},"gains":{"15d":0,"180d":7,"1d":0,"30d":1,"365d":78,"7d":null,"90d":3},"github_url":"https://github.com/MyCollab/mycollab","history_pending":false,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNjM4MTU3OQ==","stars":1363}],"schema_version":"2.0","snapshot_id":"581a0addd19361e61f828ce16e066c6e8b11a85ae393437f5b7d4a101e8b87ae","sort":"gain_7d_desc_then_stars_desc_then_name_nulls_last","topic":"springframework"}
